OL,3,AUS borrowing costs hit fresh highs over
OL,4,Ainflation fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS borrowing costs hit a fresh high on
OL,7,FTuesday as renewed strikes in the
OL,8,FMiddle East pushed up oil prices and
OL,9,Fheightened concerns over inflation.
OL,11,FThe effective interest rate on
OL,12,Fborrowing over 10 years rose to 4.79%,
OL,13,Fits highest level since January 2025,
OL,14,Fas oil prices surged above $92 a
OL,15,Fbarrel.
OL,17,FSuch movements on global bond markets
OL,18,Faffect rates at which the US government
OL,19,Fcan borrow money at, but also influence
OL,20,Frates people pay for mortgages, car
OL,21,Floans and credit cards.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
