OL,3,AUS borrowing costs hit fresh highs over
OL,4,Ainflation fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe spike in borrowing costs comes and
OL,7,Ffears over the pace of price rises in
OL,8,Fthe US has led to increased speculation
OL,9,Fthat the Federal Reserve will increase
OL,10,Finterest rates later this month.
